    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reproduce this - fire up the fcrepo4-vagrant system with audit set to true.  Add a container in fcrepo, then check the karaf logs. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
