  "description": "<p>This was found in the fcrepo4-vagrant setup.  When audit is enable, there will be exceptions in the karaf log for the various indexing routes. </p>\n\n<p>It appears that the baseURL is being set incorrectly for audit objects, so any routes that try to get information regarding those objects throw an exception.  </p>\n\n<p>I'm not clear on what's causing this, but the baseURL it's complaining about (fedora:info/) seems like it might be coming from the JMS messages that fedora emits for audit....?  </p>\n\n<p>org.fcrepo.client.FcrepoOperationFailedException: HTTP operation failed invoking info:fedora/audit/82/ab/0e/cc/82ab0ecc-65a7-4d8b-886c-d6e906e24a28 with statusCode: -1 and message: URI does not specify a valid host name: info:fedora/audit/82/ab/0e/cc/82ab0ecc-65a7-4d8b-886c-d6e906e24a28<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.client.FcrepoClient.executeRequest(FcrepoClient.java:218)<span class=\"error\">&#91;152:org.fcrepo.client.fcrepo-java-client:0.2.1&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.client.FcrepoClient.executeRequest(FcrepoClient.java:204)<span class=\"error\">&#91;152:org.fcrepo.client.fcrepo-java-client:0.2.1&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.client.RequestBuilder.perform(RequestBuilder.java:77)<span class=\"error\">&#91;152:org.fcrepo.client.fcrepo-java-client:0.2.1&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.camel.FcrepoProducer.getMetadataUri(FcrepoProducer.java:251)<span class=\"error\">&#91;201:org.fcrepo.camel.fcrepo-camel:4.5.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.camel.FcrepoProducer.getUri(FcrepoProducer.java:225)<span class=\"error\">&#91;201:org.fcrepo.camel.fcrepo-camel:4.5.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.camel.FcrepoProducer.doRequest(FcrepoProducer.java:194)<span class=\"error\">&#91;201:org.fcrepo.camel.fcrepo-camel:4.5.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.camel.FcrepoProducer.process(FcrepoProducer.java:156)<span class=\"error\">&#91;201:org.fcrepo.camel.fcrepo-camel:4.5.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.util.AsyncProcessorConverterHelper$ProcessorToAsyncProcessorBridge.process(AsyncProcessorConverterHelper.java:61)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.SendProcessor.process(SendProcessor.java:145)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.management.InstrumentationProcessor.process(InstrumentationProcessor.java:77)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.RedeliveryErrorHandler.process(RedeliveryErrorHandler.java:542)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.CamelInternalProcessor.process(CamelInternalProcessor.java:197)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.Pipeline.process(Pipeline.java:120)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.Pipeline.process(Pipeline.java:83)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.ChoiceProcessor.process(ChoiceProcessor.java:117)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.management.InstrumentationProcessor.process(InstrumentationProcessor.java:77)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.RedeliveryErrorHandler.process(RedeliveryErrorHandler.java:542)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.CamelInternalProcessor.process(CamelInternalProcessor.java:197)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.FilterProcessor.process(FilterProcessor.java:57)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.management.InstrumentationProcessor.process(InstrumentationProcessor.java:77)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.RedeliveryErrorHandler.process(RedeliveryErrorHandler.java:542)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.CamelInternalProcessor.process(CamelInternalProcessor.java:197)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.Pipeline.process(Pipeline.java:120)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.Pipeline.process(Pipeline.java:83)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.camel.processor.CamelInternalProcessor.process(CamelInternalProcessor.java:197)<span class=\"error\">&#91;58:org.apache.camel.camel-core:2.18.0&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat </p>\n\n<p>To reproduce this - fire up the fcrepo4-vagrant system with audit set to true.  Add a container in fcrepo, then check the karaf logs. </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" data-account-id=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" accountid=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Danny Bernstein</a> found this will testing the fcrepo4-vagrant. I also saw the same issue.  </p>",
